{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17510","headline":"和九华观见怀贡院八韵 · 权德舆","name":"和九华观见怀贡院八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上巳好风景，仙家足芳菲。\n地殊兰亭会，人似山阴归。\n丹竈缀珠掩，白云岩迳微。\n真宫集女士，虚室涵春辉。\n拘限心杳杳，欢言望依依。\n滞兹文墨职，坐与琴觞违。\n丽曲涤烦虚，幽缄发清机。\n支颐一吟想，恨不双翻飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}